WEBVTT

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:14.264
<i>♪ I've been catching vibes</i>
<i>So fresh and clean ♪</i>

00:00:15.557 --> 00:00:18.477
<i>♪ I can feel the sunshine calling me ♪</i>

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:20.812
<i>♪ It's a beautiful day... ♪</i>

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.023
[Mary] Who's winning?

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:25.025
<i>♪ Come out and play... ♪</i>

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:26.026
Go long!

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:29.238
Oh. Touchdown!

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:31.240
<i>♪ It's a beautiful day ♪ </i>

00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:34.284
All right, guys. Come on. Let's go.
Let's kick some ass.

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:36.036
Do just the girls wanna play?

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.704
[Maya] I'm gonna be the judge.

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:40.707
I don't want a ball to hit my stomach,
'cause what if I'm pregnant?

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.709
Do I have cellulite? Does it look bad?

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:45.254
-No, not at all.
-I'm ready.

00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:48.465
Name of the game:
don't let the ball hit the sand.

00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:52.594
If I break a nail, I'm invoicing Jason,
like, $12 for each... nail. [chuckles]

00:00:52.678 --> 00:00:54.304
[Heather] Let's go, girl! Yeah!

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.390
[cheering and yelling]

00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:00.978
-Nice job. Ow!
-[Jason] That was our best bump-set.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.438
<i>♪ Come on, fire up, fire up ♪</i>

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:05.691
<i>♪ Life in the fast lane ♪</i>

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:07.859
<i>♪ To the beat, beat, beat</i>
<i>Move it... ♪</i>

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:08.777
Point!

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.363
♪ <i>Be superhuman </i>♪

00:01:11.446 --> 00:01:12.573
[screams]

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.616
<i>♪ What you waiting for? ♪</i>

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.826
[cheering]

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:17.286
♪ <i>What you waiting for? </i>♪

00:01:17.369 --> 00:01:20.789
♪ <i>Fire me up, let's go </i>
<i>What you waiting for? </i>♪

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:21.915
[cheering]

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:24.376
Ew, you're so sweaty. Gross.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.170
[Chrishell]
I'm gonna be sore tomorrow. We both are.

00:01:27.254 --> 00:01:29.590
My booty's gonna fall out.

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:33.927
[Heather] Do we have any, 
um, like, coconut water and stuff?

00:01:34.011 --> 00:01:36.263
That's sick! 
I'm sorry, I wanna ride to the office

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:39.224
in that sick-ass creature of a bicycle.

00:01:39.308 --> 00:01:42.853
[Chrishell] That is amazing. We should ask
if she'd let us, like, take it for a spin.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.188
Am I, like, super white or what?
Am I okay?

00:01:45.272 --> 00:01:48.233
Mary, why are you...
You're quiet, Mary, over there.

00:01:48.317 --> 00:01:49.860
Why am I? Because I lost my voice.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.403
-I'm trying to save it.
-Aw.

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:53.530
She lost her voice from screaming at me.

00:01:53.614 --> 00:01:55.616
Why? Did you yell at Christine or what?

00:01:55.699 --> 00:01:58.493
-We got into a little tiff.
-Are you being mean to more girls?

00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:00.454
No, they're being mean to <i>me.</i>

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:04.666
She was just expressing her concern
about Romain and I being together,

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:08.045
and it was such a big deal
when it shouldn't have been.

00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:13.216
And then to have people judge him
and judge me based on that, it just sucks.

00:02:14.468 --> 00:02:18.513
No, I should have been more understanding
and empathetic towards you.

00:02:18.597 --> 00:02:20.015
I'm totally aware.

00:02:20.098 --> 00:02:24.144
And I know that it was coming from a place
of me seeing you be hurt before

00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:27.564
and me not wanting it to happen
and just trying to be careful for you,

00:02:27.648 --> 00:02:29.358
so I'm sorry if that came across wrong.

00:02:29.441 --> 00:02:32.986
[Mary] You had my best interests at heart,
which is the most important thing

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:35.280
and so just, whatever, let's squash it.

00:02:35.364 --> 00:02:39.409
[Maya] I mean, I think we all do. 
We don't have any intention to hurt anyone

00:02:39.493 --> 00:02:40.744
when it comes to relationships.

00:02:41.036 --> 00:02:42.746
-[Heather] Yeah.
-[Chrishell] Yeah.

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.998
[Maya] Heather, how was your vacation?

00:02:45.082 --> 00:02:46.333
It was a nice little break,

00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:49.961
being in Europe and being around
that culture, but I missed the sun. Yeah.

00:02:50.045 --> 00:02:53.090
So you think he's gonna play next year
also in Slovakia or somewhere else?

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.007
What's the plan?

00:02:54.091 --> 00:02:55.425
He signed with Sweden.

00:02:55.676 --> 00:02:57.594
-In Sweden?
-[Christine] Oh, my gosh.

00:02:57.803 --> 00:03:00.972
[Maya] What do you think about Sweden?
Like, you're going to go?

00:03:01.056 --> 00:03:03.225
I don't know. 
I mean, I wanna see how work's going...

00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:04.142
[Maya] Yeah.

00:03:04.226 --> 00:03:07.604
...and obviously, of course I wanna go
and be with him, but...

00:03:07.688 --> 00:03:09.189
You should totally go!

00:03:09.439 --> 00:03:10.899
Of course <i>you </i>want me to go.

00:03:10.982 --> 00:03:14.277
[in Swedish accent] I love 
ze furniture store, I love ze meatballs,

00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:16.780
I love ze svedish fish. I love it all.

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.448
-You'd do good there.
-You wanna come?

00:03:18.532 --> 00:03:21.034
-No, I just want you to go.
-Can you not hate me now

00:03:21.118 --> 00:03:22.077
and hate the new girl?

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.705
-Trust me, I know. I'm working on it.
-I might take the hazing on.

00:03:24.788 --> 00:03:26.081
She's gonna hate you forever

00:03:26.164 --> 00:03:28.166
or you gotta start sucking up, girl.
[chuckles]

00:03:29.501 --> 00:03:31.962
-You guys done? You shot?
-Good job, guys.

00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:34.423
[Maya] I think I'm going to head out. 
It was fun.

00:03:37.092 --> 00:03:38.844
What are you going to do about Jacob?

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:40.554
Do you think you'll give him a chance?

00:03:40.637 --> 00:03:43.140
I've always been attracted to you.
Obviously, you're beautiful.

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:46.893
I just feel like you've been showing me
houses and it's been reminding me of,

00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:49.980
you know, how well we get along
and that's tough to find.

00:03:50.188 --> 00:03:52.357
[Christine] He's sweet 
and I've known him for so long.

00:03:52.441 --> 00:03:55.152
I think I will give him a chance.
I don't know.

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:56.361
I think that's awesome.

00:03:56.445 --> 00:03:57.446
-Yeah.
-Seriously.

00:03:57.529 --> 00:04:00.198
-Don't get used to me being nice, though.
-[chuckles]

00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:04.077
I won't tell anyone. Don't worry,
I won't tell anyone. It's our secret.

00:04:07.122 --> 00:04:08.540
You have such a nice ass.

00:04:08.623 --> 00:04:09.916
[chuckles]

00:04:24.222 --> 00:04:27.476
[Chrishell] <i>So I'm super excited.</i>
<i>I got an offer for the Tara Drive house,</i>

00:04:27.559 --> 00:04:31.396
<i>and if this closes, this will be</i>
<i>the biggest deal that I've closed to date.</i>

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:35.025
<i>But this offer is a little more</i>
<i>complicated than just a straight offer.</i>

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:37.944
<i>So I wanna get to the office really early</i>
<i>and I wanna put in all the work,</i>

00:04:38.028 --> 00:04:39.780
<i>because I don't want anything to go wrong</i>

00:04:39.863 --> 00:04:42.115
<i>and I wanna beat the traffic</i>
<i>and be the first one there.</i>

00:04:42.908 --> 00:04:44.826
-Hey!
-Hey, how are you?

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.495
-How's it going?
-Good, how are you?

00:04:46.578 --> 00:04:48.038
You're here early, huh?

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.748
Yeah, I'm actually the only one here now.

00:04:50.457 --> 00:04:52.167
No one's here? Like Jason, Brett, no one?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.086
-It's nice and quiet.
-The girls? Nobody's in the bathroom?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.838
-No, uh-uh, just me.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:04:56.922 --> 00:04:59.216
Remember I told you 
I wasn't drinking in the party,

00:04:59.299 --> 00:05:01.009
-I think I might be late?
-Yeah.

00:05:01.092 --> 00:05:02.636
I bought a pregnancy test.

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:06.014
-[gasps]
-I have a showing in, like, 30 minutes,

00:05:06.097 --> 00:05:08.433
but I don't wanna wait
until the end of the day.

00:05:08.517 --> 00:05:09.476
No, take it now!

00:05:09.768 --> 00:05:13.522
I'm nervous 'cause I don't wanna
be disappointed, right?

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:17.108
'Cause it could be I'm just being late
a few days. Like, I don't know.

00:05:17.192 --> 00:05:20.362
Do you wanna just take it and get it
over with? That way you just know?

00:05:21.238 --> 00:05:22.239
Yeah.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.574
-I'm so excited!
-You wanna come wait with me?

00:05:24.658 --> 00:05:26.827
-Okay, what do you need? What can I do?
-I don't know.

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.245
I'll be there for moral support.

00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:29.538
-Okay, fine.
-How about that?

00:05:29.621 --> 00:05:32.290
I'll just be outside the door
and I'll be rooting you on. [chuckles]

00:05:32.374 --> 00:05:33.333
Okay, sounds good.

00:05:33.416 --> 00:05:34.292
[Chrishell] Yay!

00:05:35.252 --> 00:05:36.878
-I'll be right here.
-[Maya] Thanks, girl.

00:05:40.882 --> 00:05:41.925
Good luck!

00:05:51.643 --> 00:05:53.061
[Chrishell] Are you okay in there?

00:05:53.937 --> 00:05:55.230
[Maya] I'm good, girl.

00:05:56.648 --> 00:05:57.941
[water running]

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:03.613
There is a time and place for everything,
and I think right now in my life,

00:06:03.697 --> 00:06:05.991
I'm in that time and place,

00:06:06.074 --> 00:06:10.370
which I don't want 
to put work always first

00:06:10.453 --> 00:06:13.164
and I wanna expand my family
with my husband.

00:06:13.248 --> 00:06:16.960
Now when I potentially be pregnant,

00:06:17.043 --> 00:06:22.215
I want to have it positive, but I'm just
so paranoid and so cautious about it.

00:06:22.299 --> 00:06:26.052
After two miscarriages, I'm just worried
it's going to happen again.

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:28.555
Just... out of my control.

00:06:29.931 --> 00:06:30.932
How's it going?

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:34.519
I took it, but it's, 
like, thinking, so it's like...

00:06:34.644 --> 00:06:36.229
[Chrishell] Let me see what the box says.

00:06:36.313 --> 00:06:39.274
-It's a digital thing. Keep it simple.
-Three minutes.

00:06:39.357 --> 00:06:40.275
-Oh, is it?
-Okay.

00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:41.401
Can I see?

00:06:41.484 --> 00:06:44.821
It's just, like, two lines flashing.
I'm, like, nervous.

00:06:45.572 --> 00:06:48.867
'Cause, you know, we've been trying
for one year and, you know, it's like...

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:51.119
It's, like, every time, it's like...

00:06:51.703 --> 00:06:53.496
I can't imagine it, how nervous you are.

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.081
I know, right?

00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:57.500
Oh. It just needs more. [gasps]

00:06:57.959 --> 00:07:00.086
Oh, my God! [squeals]

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:01.546
[laughs]

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.089
Let me see.

00:07:03.173 --> 00:07:05.008
-Pregnant.
-You're pregnant!

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:07.510
-I'm sorry, I just screamed at you.
-I don't know what to do.

00:07:07.594 --> 00:07:09.095
I'm so excited!

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:10.055
Oh!

00:07:10.138 --> 00:07:12.474
-I need water.
-What do we do? Here.

00:07:13.475 --> 00:07:15.810
Okay, don't...
First of all, don't tell anyone.

00:07:15.894 --> 00:07:19.314
-Okay, I won't.
-My mind is, like, spinning right now.

00:07:19.397 --> 00:07:20.774
-Do you wanna sit?
-I know, right?

00:07:20.857 --> 00:07:22.484
I wanna be the first to say that to you.

00:07:22.567 --> 00:07:23.401
Sit.

00:07:23.485 --> 00:07:25.195
My heartbeat is, like, I'm so excited.

00:07:25.278 --> 00:07:27.739
But at the same time, 
because it's so early,

00:07:27.822 --> 00:07:30.659
-I just hope it's gonna be okay, you know?
-Yeah.

00:07:30.742 --> 00:07:32.702
I'm happy that I got to be here for you.

00:07:32.786 --> 00:07:34.829
-No one knows. Like, you're the first one.
-Okay.

00:07:34.913 --> 00:07:38.249
Pretend like you're just like, la-la-la,
nonchalant, even.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:40.085
Nothing was told to me today.

00:07:40.168 --> 00:07:43.088
I'm just gonna hug you one more time.
Congratulations.

00:07:43.171 --> 00:07:44.965
Thank you.

00:07:56.142 --> 00:07:57.560
[Christine] 
Mary, can I show you something?

00:07:57.644 --> 00:08:00.188
This new MLS has me
all sorts of whacked out.

00:08:00.605 --> 00:08:01.856
So let's do Beverly Hills.

00:08:02.774 --> 00:08:04.859
-Let's do Bel Air.
-Is that Hollywood?

00:08:04.943 --> 00:08:07.237
Special order for Christine.

00:08:07.612 --> 00:08:09.406
Oh, really? Aw!

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:13.618
-[Maya] For your house.
-[Christine] Oh, my God, so cute.

00:08:13.702 --> 00:08:15.704
-Hi. Thank you.
-[Davina] Christine!

00:08:16.246 --> 00:08:18.581
Can I film this
and send it to my boyfriend?

00:08:18.665 --> 00:08:20.250
[Davina] Those are gorgeous.

00:08:21.584 --> 00:08:24.045
"Hey, Christine, 
so glad we were able to reconnect,

00:08:24.129 --> 00:08:27.549
and it's been awesome
having you as a tour guide around LA.

00:08:27.632 --> 00:08:29.759
Can't wait for you to find me
the house of my dreams

00:08:29.843 --> 00:08:33.221
so we can both really say,
'Look how far we've come.'

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:35.390
-Lots of love, Jacob."
-[all] Aw.

00:08:35.473 --> 00:08:36.975
-That's so cute!
-Aw!

00:08:37.058 --> 00:08:38.935
That's really cute.

00:08:39.019 --> 00:08:40.353
What a sweetheart!

00:08:40.437 --> 00:08:42.147
So you had dinner with him?
What happened?

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:48.069
Yeah, we had dinner and we had
a really good time and, um,  I don't know.

00:08:48.153 --> 00:08:49.612
Obviously, it went well.

00:08:49.696 --> 00:08:53.366
So what is it about him that you liked
or that you didn't like?

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:55.410
I mean, he's really sweet.

00:08:55.493 --> 00:08:58.246
-[Davina] Okay.
-He's so nice. He's so funny.

00:08:58.329 --> 00:09:01.666
But I just don't get 
that, like, passion and chemistry.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.877
You don't want to jump his bones?
Yeah.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:06.838
But, I mean, I think you should give it
at least a couple of dates.

00:09:06.921 --> 00:09:08.548
I mean, sometimes it takes time.

00:09:08.631 --> 00:09:12.093
He might grow on you a little bit more.
And if not, then you guys remain friends.

00:09:12.177 --> 00:09:13.970
I don't want someone
who grows on me, though.

00:09:14.054 --> 00:09:16.431
I want someone who I like instantly.
Like, wow.

00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:17.474
I wanted that too.

00:09:17.557 --> 00:09:19.184
In the long run,
that's not the best thing.

00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:21.102
I agree. My husband grew on me.

00:09:21.186 --> 00:09:24.022
[Davina] But you do have to, 
you know, feel attraction.

00:09:24.105 --> 00:09:26.316
Christine, I think you should
totally go for him.

00:09:26.608 --> 00:09:28.276
I agree with Mary. Give him a chance.

00:09:28.359 --> 00:09:29.944
-I think so, too.
-What's it gonna hurt?

00:09:30.028 --> 00:09:33.615
Flowers are so sweet,
so I'm voting for him.

00:09:33.698 --> 00:09:35.950
[chuckles]
Do we get to vote? Are we voting?

00:09:36.034 --> 00:09:37.327
Who is Team Jacob?

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.704
Maybe I'll entertain dinner
with him again, you know.

00:09:39.788 --> 00:09:41.831
-Yay!
-Maybe I will.

00:09:41.915 --> 00:09:44.876
-[Maya] We totally sold her on Jacob.
-Okay, fine.

00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:46.669
[Maya chuckles]

00:09:49.839 --> 00:09:51.049
[whimpers]

00:09:53.301 --> 00:09:54.761
[Chrishell] Hi.

00:09:54.844 --> 00:09:57.722
Um, I have, um, good and bad news.

00:09:57.806 --> 00:10:01.267
Um, okay, so I have 
an offer for Tara Drive.

00:10:02.477 --> 00:10:06.356
It's obviously beautiful, and I do think
that it's gonna sell quickly.

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:09.067
Well, let me get some stats 
of what you are looking for

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.401
and give you my information.

00:10:10.485 --> 00:10:11.986
So that's super exciting,

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:15.156
but it's contingent 
that their house sells.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.242
-If the buyer's house sells?
-Yeah.

00:10:17.325 --> 00:10:19.160
So it's not just a straight offer.

00:10:19.494 --> 00:10:21.079
Is their house on the market already?

00:10:21.162 --> 00:10:25.208
It's not, but it's ready to go
on the market, so...

00:10:25.333 --> 00:10:27.043
There's a couple of ways we can do it.

00:10:27.127 --> 00:10:30.338
One, the buyer can release
non-refundable funds.

00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:33.508
The other way to do it is just
to not offer any non-refundable funds

00:10:33.591 --> 00:10:36.219
and to get into escrow,
but you have to give the seller an out.

00:10:36.302 --> 00:10:38.805
So if the seller gets a better offer,
they can kick the buyer out.

00:10:38.888 --> 00:10:41.224
-But they won't lose any money?
-They won't lose any money.

00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:46.437
When you release non-refundable funds,
basically that's you saying, like,

00:10:46.521 --> 00:10:48.606
"Okay, I'm putting all this money at risk.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:52.110
If for some reason 
I don't end up buying your house,

00:10:52.193 --> 00:10:55.446
now you get to keep all that money
for the inconvenience."

00:10:55.738 --> 00:10:57.949
We can triple end it.
We can represent the seller,

00:10:58.032 --> 00:11:01.411
the buyer, and the buyer's home, and maybe
even the buyer of the buyer's home.

00:11:01.786 --> 00:11:04.831
Okay, that would be amazing.
But no pressure.

00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:07.792
-There <i>is</i> pressure. Let's get this done.
-All right.

00:11:07.876 --> 00:11:09.919
[Jason] <i>This is </i>
<i>a really complicated transaction.</i>

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:14.007
That said, I expect anyone at this office
to close it and that includes Chrishell.

00:11:14.424 --> 00:11:16.050
Hey, Mark, it's Chrishell Hartley.

00:11:16.134 --> 00:11:19.512
I am just calling you to let you know
that we got an offer on the house,

00:11:19.596 --> 00:11:22.891
which is amazing, but I need to talk
to you a little bit about it,

00:11:22.974 --> 00:11:25.310
so just give me a call back when you can.
Thanks.

