but I was a little worried for her

00:12:34.254 --> 00:12:37.548
after their, like, 
rocky anniversary dinner or whatever.

00:12:37.632 --> 00:12:40.760
Like, her reaction 
kind of made me, you know, wonder.

00:12:40.843 --> 00:12:43.346
When I met her and him, I thought 
it was more like good for her,

00:12:43.429 --> 00:12:46.474
like it was her boy toy, and then
when they got engaged, I was like,

00:12:46.557 --> 00:12:51.521
