It could've been staged and finished

00:16:16.142 --> 00:16:17.560
-and photographed a week ago.
-Yeah.

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:19.353
I wanna know what happened.

00:16:20.229 --> 00:16:21.856
[sighs] Um...

00:16:21.939 --> 00:16:23.316
I definitely...

00:16:24.317 --> 00:16:27.278
let my personal life get 
in the middle of work.

00:16:27.361 --> 00:16:29.030
I took a call with Nick

00:16:29.113 --> 00:16:32.909
right in the middle of going over 
the staging of the house so...

00:16:33.743 --> 00:16:36.370
It's hard, 'cause I never know
when he's gonna call.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.956
You know, your priority's to your clients

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.958
-and to selling homes.
-Yeah.

00:16:41.042 --> 00:16:43.211
So that's where my interests lie.

00:16:43.461 --> 00:16:46.839
So I do not wanna minimize
and I fully respect

00:16:46.923 --> 00:16:48.799
-that you have a lot on your plate...
-Yeah.

00:16:48.883 --> 00:16:50.885
...but this is the priority.

00:16:50.968 --> 00:16:52.803
-I know. I'm here to work.
-Okay.

00:16:52.887 --> 00:16:54.430
And that needs to be my focus.

00:16:54.514 --> 00:16:56.182
But it's not the end of the world.

00:16:56.265 --> 00:16:58.768
You can recover. What you need
to do is sell it for a great price

00:16:58.851 --> 00:17:01.646
-and everybody will forget everything.
-I know. Okay.

00:17:01.729 --> 00:17:03.814
-And no phone calls during the open house.
-Yeah.

00:17:08.486 --> 00:17:11.197
<i>♪ If you're gonna move, come on ♪</i>

