Actually, Chrishell was asking
a lot of questions about Mary and Romain.

00:17:44.897 --> 00:17:47.400
-Oh, really?
-Yeah, like does he even make money?

00:17:47.483 --> 00:17:50.820
Like, does he have a job?
Does he even pay for anything?

00:17:50.903 --> 00:17:52.321
That's not cool, you know?

00:17:52.405 --> 00:17:56.409
Like, and then I feel like, "Oh, are you
gonna talk about <i>me </i>behind my back, too?"

00:17:56.492 --> 00:17:57.743
She's so nice to Mary,

00:17:57.827 --> 00:18:01.372
but she didn't say anything
about how she really feels to her face.

00:18:01.455 --> 00:18:03.624
I mean, I get the concern,
at the same time.

00:18:03.708 --> 00:18:04.709
[Davina] Sure.

00:18:04.792 --> 00:18:07.545
-it's none of our business.
-It's none of our business.

00:18:07.628 --> 00:18:09.505
But I feel like if you have
such strong opinions,

00:18:09.547 --> 00:18:12.592
don't come talk to me about it.
Go talk to Mary about it, you know?

00:18:12.717 --> 00:18:15.261
I'm gonna have Mary's back more than,
like, Chrishell.

00:18:15.344 --> 00:18:16.887
-Like, you're the new girl.
-Yeah.

00:18:18.889 --> 00:18:21.601
<i>♪ Watch me like cable</i>
<i>I'll let you decide ♪</i>

00:18:21.684 --> 00:18:24.186
<i>♪ A hustle so real, certified ♪</i>

00:18:25.187 --> 00:18:26.731
<i>♪ What you, what you gonna do ♪</i>

00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:30.234
<i>♪ When you look rear view</i>
<i>And I'm right at your tail ♪</i>

00:18:31.193 --> 00:18:36.240
<i>♪ Never matters how far I'm behind </i>
<i>In the end, I don't know how to bail ♪</i>

