♪ <i>Throw me straight into the fight </i>♪

00:18:39.118 --> 00:18:41.287
<i>♪ Come now, diamonds</i>
<i>I'm a fighter ♪</i>

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:44.665
<i>-♪ He versus me and no one else ♪</i> 
<i>-♪ No one ♪</i>

00:18:44.749 --> 00:18:48.169
-Do we need to get a fireplace?
-[Mary] Hey, guys.

00:18:48.252 --> 00:18:49.629
-Able to do that?
-Yeah.

00:18:49.712 --> 00:18:51.380
Yeah, 'cause it's just an appliance.

00:18:51.464 --> 00:18:52.465
-Oh, what's up, girl?
-Hey.

00:18:52.548 --> 00:18:54.216
-[Jhoiey] Hi.
-[Jason] Thanks for making it.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.635
-Of course!
-Mwah!

00:18:55.926 --> 00:18:57.803
Oh, my God, it looks so good.

00:18:57.887 --> 00:19:00.890
